        零售电商 × 客服售后<br>
        <span class="badge b-ghost" style="margin-top:6px">虚拟客户 · 该格 71 条真实案例汇编</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 评分面板 -->
    <div>
      <!-- 自动分区 -->
      <div class="card">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <span class="badge b-auto">✅ 脚本已算好</span> 不用你管
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px">这部分由评分脚本自动落盘，讲师<b>只读不填</b>。字段来源：D04 定稿 v1.1。</p>
        <table>
          <tr><th>层级</th><th>项</th><th>算法 / 依据</th><th>本组值</th><th>来源</th></tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="badge b-ghost">维度</span></td>
            <td><b>价值分</b><span class="mono" style="color:var(--faint)"> .45</span></td>
            <td class="mono">Δ实际 ÷ Δ上限</td>
            <td class="mono"><b>0.62</b></td>
            <td><span class="badge b-info">EvalRun</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="badge b-ghost">子项</span></td>
            <td><b>工程分 A</b><span class="mono" style="color:var(--faint)"> .35</span></td>
            <td>原型真跑起来（非伪代码/截图）</td>
            <td class="mono"><b>1.00</b> ✅</td>
            <td><span class="badge b-info">脚本探测</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="badge b-ghost">子项</span></td>
            <td><b>工程分 B</b><span class="mono" style="color:var(--faint)"> .30</span></td>
            <td>Eval v1.0 冻结 + holdout 隔离</td>
            <td class="mono"><b>1.00</b> ✅</td>
            <td><span class="badge b-info">脚本校验</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="badge b-ghost">子项</span></td>
